<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>ImageCompress third-party licenses</title>
<style>
  body { font: 14px/1.5 -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 52rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #222; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: .75rem; border-radius: 4px; }
  .license-used-by { color: #555; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { background: #1c1c1e; color: #ddd; } pre { background: #2a2a2c; } .license-used-by { color: #999; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>ImageCompress binaries are licensed GPL-3.0-or-later (see COPYING). They include the following Rust crates and the C/C++ libraries bundled inside them. Additional notices (IJG, AOM patent license, gifsicle, Sparkle, musl, ...) are in the other files of this folder.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<hr>
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p class="license-used-by">Used by:</p>
<ul class="license-used-by">
{{#each used_by}}
  <li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{#if crate.repository}} - <a href="{{crate.repository}}">{{crate.repository}}</a>{{/if}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
